"退出演示" = "Exit demo";
"演示里只有蓝框标出的地方能点" = "In the demo, only the places outlined in blue can be tapped";
"演示画面是录好的，不能滚动；连上自己的 Mac 后就能真实操作" = "Demo screens are recordings and don't scroll. Connect your own Mac to drive a real phone";
